<title>JAPAN: Shizuoka Bank up on share buy-back plan.</title>
<headline>Shizuoka Bank up on share buy-back plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Shizuoka Bank Ltd rose on Tuesday morning after the firm said it planned to change its company regulations to allow it to buy back up to 80 million of its own shares, traders said.</p>
<p>As of 0135 GMT, the regional bank located in central Japan was up 50 yen at 1,300. Volume was 806,000 shares.</p>
</text>
